        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samuel Parker, James II of England\n- Roles: Bishop of Oxford, King of England, King of Ireland, King of Scotland\n- Events: Glorious Revolution\n- Topics: attitudes to Catholics\n\nFacts:\n- James II and VII was born on 14 October 1633 and died on 16 September 1701.\n- James II and VII ruled as King of England and Ireland as James II and as King of Scotland as James VII from 6 February 1685 until he was deposed in the Glorious Revolution of 1688.\n- During the reign of James II, Samuel Parker served as Bishop of Oxford.\n- James II considered Samuel Parker moderate in his attitude to Catholics.",
